OL,3,CKorean restaurant shut down after
OL,4,C'shocking' mouse infestation discovered
OL,6,FA Korean restaurant in Portsmouth has
OL,7,Fbeen shut down after inspectors found
OL,8,Fa 'shocking' mouse infestation.
OL,10,FGalbi Korean Restaurant on Albert Road
OL,11,Fin Southsea has been ordered to close
OL,12,Fimmediately.
OL,14,FMouse droppings were discovered on
OL,15,Foven shelves, next to open boxes of
OL,16,Ffood and underneath drinking glasses
OL,17,Fin the bar.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
