OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785775682
OL,3,CKorean restaurant shut down after
OL,4,C'shocking' mouse infestation discovered
OL,6,FA large gap was discovered under the
OL,7,Frear kitchen door and a missing pane
OL,8,Fof glass above the entrance door which
OL,9,Fallowed rodents to enter the building.
OL,11,FAn oriental cockroach was also found
OL,12,Ffloating in a container of water in
OL,13,Fthe bar, and dirty equipment was found.
OL,15,FCllr Lee Hunt, Cabinet Member for
OL,16,FCommunity Safety, Leisure & Sport,
OL,17,Fsaid: "What our officers uncovered
OL,18,Fduring this inspection was shocking.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
