FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785775682
OL,3,CKorean restaurant shut down after
OL,4,C'shocking' mouse infestation discovered
OL,6,F"The premises were filthy, there was
OL,7,Fclear evidence of an active mouse
OL,8,Finfestation, and mouse droppings were
OL,9,Fdiscovered next to open food and even
OL,10,Finside an oven.
OL,12,F"The public should expect food
OL,13,Fbusinesses to operate to the highest
OL,14,Fhygiene standards.
OL,16,F"The conditions at this restaurant
OL,17,Fwere completely unacceptable and posed
OL,18,Fa serious risk to public health, which
OL,19,Fis why we took immediate action to
OL,20,Fclose the premises."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/3
